@startuml
actor Lecturer
boundary QuizCreationPage
control QuizController
database Database
control AssignmentService
boundary ProgressDashboard

Lecturer -> QuizCreationPage: Access quiz creation interface
QuizCreationPage -> Lecturer: Display fields for questions, answers, categories, and points
Lecturer -> QuizCreationPage: Enter quiz details (questions, answers, categories, points)
Lecturer -> QuizCreationPage: Click "Review Quiz" button
QuizCreationPage -> QuizController: POST /api/createQuiz with quiz details
QuizController -> QuizController: Validate quiz data
alt Data is valid
    QuizController -> Database: Save quiz details with categories and points
    Database --> QuizController: Return save status
    alt Quiz creation succeeded
        QuizController -> QuizCreationPage: Display option to assign quiz or not
        alt Assign quiz
            QuizCreationPage -> Lecturer: Select group or individual for assignment
            Lecturer -> QuizCreationPage: Enter assignment details
            QuizCreationPage -> QuizController: POST /api/assignQuiz with selected group/individual
            QuizController -> AssignmentService: Assign quiz to group/individual
            AssignmentService -> AssignmentService: Perform assignment
            AssignmentService --> QuizController: Return assignment status
            QuizController -> QuizCreationPage: Display assignment success or failure
            QuizCreationPage -> Lecturer: Confirm assignment
        else No assignment
            QuizCreationPage -> Lecturer: Confirm quiz creation without assignment
        end
    else Quiz creation failed
        QuizController -> QuizCreationPage: Display error message
    end
else Data is invalid
    QuizController -> QuizCreationPage: Display validation errors
end

Lecturer -> ProgressDashboard: View progress and results
ProgressDashboard -> Database: Retrieve quiz results and progress
Database --> ProgressDashboard: Return progress and results
ProgressDashboard -> Lecturer: Display progress and results

@enduml
